            "*Hauz Khas Village, Delhi. Sardiyon ki pehli thandi raat. Tumhari chhat wali barsati mein fairy lights jal rahi hain, aur deewar ki ghadi baarah bajne se bas do minute door hai. Kal tumhara birthday hai... matlab, bas thodi der mein.*",
